    "name": "Gun Of Fate : The Silver Gun Of Ylia",
    "steam_appid": 3242510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a legendary gunslinger and roam a Wild West filled with danger and glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>Shooter \u00d7 Adventure \u00d7 RPG</strong>,<br>you\u2019ll step into the vast, fictional land known as the <i>West</i> \u2014<br>a place teeming with ruthless outlaws, wild beasts lurking in the wilderness, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Draw Your Gun</strong> \u2013 Face notorious gangs and ferocious beasts, and prove your skill and courage!<br>\ud83d\uddfa <strong>Explore</strong>\u2013 Take on side quests, hunt for rare items, and upgrade your gear.<br>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>More Than Gunfights</strong> \u2013 Enjoy fishing, horse racing, and other activities that bring your journey to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in the shadows of this vast frontier,<br>an infamous criminal organization known as <strong>&quot;Deathly Thirteen&quot;</strong> is on the rise.<br>As the gunslinger chosen by fate, you will play a pivotal role in the fight against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Load your weapon and write your own legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/e91bd0fe956e39f6424ac93783fb76a7.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/3341feba4ee69b03f5db34428d68ae23.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will battle with different type of enemies. From Outlaws to Wild Beasts. Different weapon options are available to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/50f8c92a90e151a608e0fc2bcac098f1.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/25c88e5bb6fdcb366bef83a589a85126.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1593 height=897 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the story and battle system, there will Quest system where player can accept quest from Tavern. And also player can buy items and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/61d13a1f233bb5b1cdc6ae280ddcb32b.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/34fb10052d10ba1cb3863b92f9fe30ba.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/c3dd98d0d4677ef342f1d3f3759d1b45.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also side activities where player can try to complete and unlock. Such as Horse Racing and Fishing system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/1b4e9c036c440e90ce9c9011210fc583.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/0e66b22629d9d28b9dca95b0b8f8c1d3.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a legendary gunslinger and roam a Wild West filled with danger and glory!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>Shooter \u00d7 Adventure \u00d7 RPG</strong>,<br>you\u2019ll step into the vast, fictional land known as the <i>West</i> \u2014<br>a place teeming with ruthless outlaws, wild beasts lurking in the wilderness, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Draw Your Gun</strong> \u2013 Face notorious gangs and ferocious beasts, and prove your skill and courage!<br>\ud83d\uddfa <strong>Explore</strong>\u2013 Take on side quests, hunt for rare items, and upgrade your gear.<br>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>More Than Gunfights</strong> \u2013 Enjoy fishing, horse racing, and other activities that bring your journey to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in the shadows of this vast frontier,<br>an infamous criminal organization known as <strong>&quot;Deathly Thirteen&quot;</strong> is on the rise.<br>As the gunslinger chosen by fate, you will play a pivotal role in the fight against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Load your weapon and write your own legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/e91bd0fe956e39f6424ac93783fb76a7.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/3341feba4ee69b03f5db34428d68ae23.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will battle with different type of enemies. From Outlaws to Wild Beasts. Different weapon options are available to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/50f8c92a90e151a608e0fc2bcac098f1.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/25c88e5bb6fdcb366bef83a589a85126.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1593 height=897 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the story and battle system, there will Quest system where player can accept quest from Tavern. And also player can buy items and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/61d13a1f233bb5b1cdc6ae280ddcb32b.avif?t=1755044452\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/34fb10052d10ba1cb3863b92f9fe30ba.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/c3dd98d0d4677ef342f1d3f3759d1b45.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also side activities where player can try to complete and unlock. Such as Horse Racing and Fishing system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/1b4e9c036c440e90ce9c9011210fc583.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242510/extras/0e66b22629d9d28b9dca95b0b8f8c1d3.avif?t=1755044452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
